[en.DECISION_C01_C15_WAR]
Intervene Crystal Empire’s independence

[en.DECISION_C01_C15_WAR_desc]
The crystal empire is seeking independence from the Changeling Empire, which is, at this stage, not our business.
However, if they ever succeed, their next step towards independence will be challenging our authority.
Therefore, we will destroy such thought before it even begins.

[zh.DECISION_C01_C15_WAR]
干预水晶帝国独立

[zh.DECISION_C01_C15_WAR_desc]
水晶帝国正在寻求独立，在这个阶段，这不是我们需要担心的事情。
但是，如果他们实现了目标，那么他们进一步独立的下一个目标，自然会是挑战我们的权威。
因此，我们要将这种念头扼杀在萌芽里。
